  "description": "Gadamhangseol, the popular webtoon with a perfect score on Naver, tells a story set during the Joseon Dynasty featuring fantasy elements.\n\n\"Bog-A,\" who prays for his master who set off alone for Hanyang to overcome his past, somehow turned a stone into a human. And thus his adventure with the new human \"Han-Seol\" to inform the King of this miracle begins.\n\n(Source: Wisdom House, translated and edited)\n\n*Note: Includes 6 chapters of side stories.*",
